+## Net worth
+
+`networth --until DATE` sums every posting to `Assets`, `Liabilities` and
+their descendants dated on or before each row's date, per commodity. Rows
+fall on the last day of each month from the `--from` month (by default the
+month of the first transaction) through the `--until` month; the last row
+is the `--until` date itself. Each line is the date, two spaces and the
+amount in the 14-character column `balance` uses:
+
+```text
+2026-01-31       2457.50
+2026-02-28       2410.00
+2026-03-15       2600.00
+```
+
+`--convert COMMODITY` converts each row exactly as `balance --convert`
+does, with the row's date in place of `--at`. `--forecast` also counts
+occurrences of periodic transactions dated after the last real transaction.
+
